2. "Void Field" background renderer
-----------------------------------

Location in this repository: src/components/venue/VoidFieldCanvas.tsx

Description: ambient WebGL dot-matrix background. The file's fragment shader,
vertex shader, WebGL program setup, and pointer-drift handling are derived
from the upstream "Void Field" component by Meng To. The modifications made
for this project are documented in that file's own header comment: the
original purple tint (vec3(0.7, 0.3, 1.0)) is replaced with the venue
caramel tint, the surface is alpha-composited over the page background,
backing resolution is capped at devicePixelRatio <= 2, and reduced-motion,
tab-visibility, debounced-resize, and WebGL context-loss handling were added.

Upstream source pages:
  https://threeui.com/backgrounds/predictive-arc/void-field
  https://github.com/MengTo/threeui
  https://21st.dev/@mengto/components/void-field

